d McArthur to Hurlbut"}]]}],["$","div","Remnant of the 6th Division",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Remnant of the 6th Division"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Benjamin M. Prentiss"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Rallied survivors and the fresh 23rd Missouri along the farm lane"}]]}],["$","div","4th Division",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"4th Division"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Stephen A. Hurlbut"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Two brigades on Prentiss’s left, extending through Bell Field"}]]}],["$","div","Detached brigade, Sherman’s division",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Detached brigade, Sherman’s division"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"David Stuart"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Three regiments on the extreme United States left near the river"}]]}]]]}],["$","section","Confederacy",{"className":"command-column #9a3d32","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Confederacy"}],[["$","div","Army of the Mississippi",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Army of the Mississippi"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Albert Sidney Johnston"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Directed the front, diverted troops toward Stuart, and weakened the center"}]]}],["$","div","Rear headquarters",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Rear headquarters"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"P.G.T. Beauregard"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Sent additional formations toward the fighting around Shiloh Church"}]]}],["$","div","Brigade, Hardee’s corps",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Brigade, Hardee’s corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Patrick Cleburne"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Six regiments; terrain split the line during attacks near Ray Field"}]]}],["$","div","Brigade, Bragg’s corps",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Brigade, Bragg’s corps"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Patton Anderson"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Joined attacks against Sherman"}]]}],["$","div","Brigades, Polk’s corps",{"className":"command-entry","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Brigades, Polk’s corps"}],"$L23","$L24"]}],"$L25","$L26"]]}]]}],"$L27","$L28"]}]
